[4056]="700166F9\n1\tPlant the banner at Uruk-gashan\030Collect Dwarf-banner\030Plant the banner at Drû-garmadh\030Plant the banner at Athmadhul\tThe Orc-camps Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh, and Athmadhul are to the south-east of Mekhem-bizru. Raskwith asked you to go to the three Orc-camps in the Dimrill Dale and plant dwarf-flags in each, to show the Orcs that the Dale will never be theirs.\n2\tTalk to Raskwith at Mekhem-bizru\tRaskwith is in Mekhem-bizru, north-west of the Orc-camps. Raskwith will be pleased to hear that the banners have been placed in the Orc-camps.\n",
[4057]="70017B8D\n1\tDefeat Bogrian's morroval-guards (total: 5)\030Defeat Bogrian's morvul-defilers (total: 5)\tThe passage to Zirakzigil lies west through the gardens, then north. Folkath has instructed you to prevent Bogrian's expedition from bringing back any potentially valuable or dangerous trophies from the Balrog's remains.\n2\tUse the horn on Bogrian's banner to summon and defeat her\tBogrian's banner is located among the merrevail detachment on Zirakzigil. Bogrian may be called out of hiding by using the horns on her banner to summon her forth.\n3\tTalk to Oxi at Jazârgund\tOxi is at Jazârgund, south and east of the entrance to Zirakzigil. Oxi is awaiting your return and hoping for your success.\n",
[4058]="7002EF00\n1\tDefeat Matumkâr\tMatumkâr will likely be found near Wadel's home in Thornhope. Wadel has asked you to kill Matumkâr, the Orc who led the band that murdererd his family.\n2\tTalk to Wadel outside Thornhope\tWadel is encamped outside the walls of Thornhope. You should return to Wadel with news of your victory over Matumkâr.\n",
[4059]="70058B89\n1\tDestroy noxious cauldrons at Azgh-buzru (total: 6)\tNoxious cauldrons can be found across Azgh-buzru, especially among siege installations. Dréri has asked you to destroy noxious cauldrons at Azgh-buzru.\n2\tTalk to Dréri at Drenghól\tDréri can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks. You have destroyed many noxious cauldrons at Azgh-buzru and impaired Gorgar's usage of this vile weaponry. You should report to Dréri at Drenghól.\n",
[4060]="70046C42\n1\tSearch to the north of Jarl Gurthilm's company\030Search to the east of Jarl Gurthilm's company\030Search to the west of Jarl Gurthilm's company\tJarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien. Jarl Gurthilm has asked you to search the lands surrounding his company in hopes of routing more attacks by the Khundolar.\n2\tTalk to Jarl Gurthilm\tJarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien. You have routed the Khundolar ambushers and uncovered their grisly handiwork. You should return to Jarl Gurthilm.\n",
[4061]="70028C6D\n1\tDefeat goblins in the Isendale (total: 8)\030Collect Rohirrim belongings (total: 3)\tThe cave mouth where the goblins may be found lies to the north of Cadthorn's position, along the ridge. Cadthorn has asked you to hunt down the goblins that attacked his party, drive them off, and recover his companions' stolen belongings.\n2\tTalk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond\tArdwyn is at Forthbrond, south and east of the goblin-cave. Cadthorn asked you to bring the effects of the fallen Rohirrim to Ardwyn.\n",
[4062]="7004BEAE\n1\tChallenge those who oppose Khirgi\tA good place to challenge opposers can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should challenge those that would oppose the Khundolar.\n2\tHold your ground and defeat the rowdy Haradrim\tYou should hold your ground! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to the Khundolar Commander\tThe Khundolar Commander can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to the Khundolar Commander.\n",
[4063]="70057D01\n1\tTroublesome hobbits can be found around the Shire. A sneaky hobbit has asked you to deliver deceptive invitations to her troublesome neighbours.\t\n2\tReturn to the sneaky hobbit at the Party Tree\tThe sneaky hobbit can be found near the Party Tree in the Shire. You should let the sneaky hobbit know that you have delivered all of the invitations.\n",
[4064]="70040B0D\n1\tFight corsairs at Makham Mijann\tThe corsair camp Makham Mijann is located in eastern Belfalas, along the River Ringló. Fight corsairs at Makham Mijann.\n2\tFight corsairs at Makham Mijann (total: 14)\tThe corsair camp Makham Mijann is located in eastern Belfalas, along the River Ringló. Fight corsairs at Makham Mijann.\n3\tCompleted\tFought corsairs at Makham Mijann.\n",
